it's officially the one year anniversary  of starting this show and we want to  thank all of you for sticking with us so  to celebrate this time we're going to  explore the lands above and beyond and  break the boundaries of breath of the  wild as usual let us know if you want to  keep learning new things by liking this  video  you can easily break open or burn wooden  boxes to get the goodies inside but you  can never do the same to metal chests  they never break but did you know  there's actually one way to do this  death mountain's cannon can completely  destroy metal chests and drop the loot  inside  even amiibo armor  well that's just weird without any sort  of mods it's actually possible to go  into space in breath of the wild albeit  with a lot of prep work first by first  performing a complex glitch called  memory storage then performing another  glitch called inventory corruption you  can get 80 000 arrows basically the  amount of fuel you need to break the  atmosphere then by performing more  glitches such as apparatus storage then  jumping in a death mountain getting moon  jump then pulling out a bomb arrow will  start your journey slowly towards the  stars you can even sort of see the edge  of the atmosphere from up here  and remember many episodes ago when i  said that maybe we'll be able to grab  that shock arrow one day well for glitch  hunters if there's a will there's a way  and this technique also lets you grab  that impossible shock arrow  easy peasy previously i've shown this  mysterious apple tree behind dog choco  shrine placed here for seemingly no  reason but did you know that there's  actually more stuff even farther back  behind the shrine using a couple  glitches you can walk freely around the  lost woods for a short time and if you  head farther back into the lost woods  you can actually find a hearty truffle  and two razor shrooms hanging out back  here completely impossible to get  through normal gameplay between the  beehive apples mushrooms and truffles  all out of reach it's theorized that  nintendo was building the space to be a  playable area then abandoned it and  completely forgot to remove these assets  [Music]  did you know that there are several  places in gerudo town that are safe for  you to stand in without a disguise  besides the obvious gerudo secret club  you can climb inside the southeast gate  on top of the waterway  the two cornerstones  and straight over the wall on the  northwest gate  did you know that you can lift up large  barrels like this with rivoli's gale  and even go for a little ride on it this  can extend your gale's reach  you can even walk backwards on it as  well like in the circus  there's a couple ways to escape the  borders of hyrule but out here as you'd  expect there isn't much of anything but  you can reach this unreachable mountain  far east of hyrule  did you know that almost all the gerudo  and hyrule greet you accordingly to the  time of day  [Music]  good morning good evening and good night  before starting any conversation even  frida the traveling rito learning gerudo  responds in the same way  for some players it was really obvious  to try to enter this fake doorway but  others may not know about the secret  gerudo club interaction  spear liners are often known for doing a  jumping plunge attack against link but  sword and crusher lynels are able to do  this as well and they have their own  special animation for it  there's a grassy plateau far west of  hyrule impossible to reach because of  its high winds and void out areas but by  using blss to zip through the wind  before it gets a chance to load in you  can access the hidden plateau  [Music]  this area even spawns dynamic enemies  just like anywhere else in hyrule  did you know said on can be knocked out  by pushing him out of the zora domain  you can have enemies attack him and  knock him out even though he's never in  a combat situation like this during  normal gameplay nintendo still coded the  dialogue and animations of him being  knocked out and recovering just in case  when talking to selmy the shield surfer  she lets you take a shot at shield  surfing down heber mountain to race  against a time but sometimes she'll  comment on what shield you have equipped  on your back which happens with only six  specific shields the steel lizard  dawnbreaker  radiant shield  gerudo shield  royal shield  and her least favorite the royal guard  shield  very early in the development of breath  of the wild many npcs were still in the  concept and design phase not ready at  all for implementation so to work around  this nintendo used older assets in their  place until the npcs were ready this  photo shows breath of the wild link  interacting with mila from wind waker in  place of riju and greba from skyward  sword acting as bulliara this would have  been an amazing crossover did you know  that it's possible to cut down a tree  with a spear well at least moblins can  not link blink spear attacks are all  poking attacks never able to cut a tree  but maublin's swings are so strong they  can even cut a tree down with the weak  vocal spear not even mccoblin and  lizolfos are capable of doing this  nintendo was pretty ambitious when it  came to designing horse behaviors and  many cute ideas were unfortunately cut  likely due to them being too difficult  or not important enough to implement  from this small list here only two made  it which were eating items and shaking  when getting out of the water they also  wanted cheek nuzzling dancing with music  a playful run tree branch eating and  sticking its head through a house window  probably inspired by the beginning of  skyward sword  there are a ton of examples through the  game checking if you did something out  of order and reacting accordingly  like in the zora domain there's a  separate cutscene for meeting the zora  king before beating sidon and an extra  zelda cutscene if you never met imba  first  did you know that you could stand on top  of korok balloons  [Music]  have you wanted to see what one of these  korok flowers look from underneath well  here you go  pretty much any zelda fan who's watched  speed runs have heard of the infamous  super swim which lets you swim at  ridiculous speeds but by clipping  through the ground moon jumping clipping  through the water layer by shield  jumping and waiting for link to fall  through the water layer then jumping  back up to touch the water later again  this triggers breath of the wild's  version of a super swim  the strange thing is it even has key  similarities to wind waker's version  such as holding the opposite direction  to go forward and splashing if you stop  too quickly  most npcs cower and fear of monsters but  moza the terrible cook is capable of  putting up a fight since she has  equipped weapons if pushed far enough  this ladle and pot wielding hylian can  hold her own against dangerous monsters  or maybe not  previously i've shown that if you quick  menu while turning towards a shop item  you can see some really strange numbers  appear for everyday items this actually  shows something that's pretty  interesting behind the scenes this was  the default template they used in the  proprietary version of a program you can  purchase called layout editor as seen  here that has the same double overlay  text on top the extra stamina wheel the  same star and 100 base attack this  program apparently saved them a lot of  time in production as normal production  consists of creating the asset checking  the viewer implementing it into the game  then checking if it works properly but  in this case they were able to make the  item then immediately reflect it in the  game they sure know how to be efficient  one year later and we're still on the  never ending quest to find breath of the  wild secrets if you enjoyed this series  let us know and check out our other  breath of the wild content including  breakdown of today's advanced combat and  easy tricks you can learn yourself for  anything else gaming stay right here on  gamespot  [Music]

